     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nDear Distance Sampling list</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">We are pleased to announce that our survey design and simulation packages &#39;dssd&#39; and\r\n &#39;dsims&#39; are now back on CRAN.</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">These packages are no longer dependent on sp and rgeos which have now been retired. In addition, we have made\r\n the required fix with regard to the particular setup of the ATLAS / BLAS linear algebra environment used on one of the CRAN test machines.</span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Details of other bug fixes and enhancements can be found in the package NEWS files.</span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/dssd/NEWS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/dssd/NEWS&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792471970917000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3xHn-Ur1bYWz3m3Kvr_lKL\">https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/dssd/NEWS</a></span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/dsims/NEWS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/dsims/NEWS&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792471970917000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3tN8dvyXPAC1PybM84cAhh\">https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/dsims/NEWS</a></span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Best wishes,</span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Laura</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Dr. L Marshall</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Centre for Research into Ecological &amp; Environmental Modelling</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">University of St. Andrews</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;fo